const MANIFEST = {
  "type": "Layout.Accordion",
  "description": "Expandable accordion with smooth height animations and rotating icons",
  "editorElement": {
    "selector": ".accordion",
    "displayName": "Accordion",
    "archetype": "container",
    "data": {
      "items": {
        "dataType": "text",
        "displayName": "Accordion Items",
        "defaultValue": "What makes Lumen different from other analytics tools?|Lumen pairs real-time event tracking with a drag-and-drop dashboard builder, so teams at companies like Basecamp and Statamic ship reports in minutes instead of days.,How does Lumen's pricing work?|Plans start at $29/month for up to 10,000 tracked events and scale to $249/month for 1M events, with custom volume pricing above that.,Is there a free trial?|Yes — every plan includes a 14-day free trial with full feature access, no credit card required.,What support options are available?|All plans include 24/7 email support with a 4-hour response guarantee; Business and Enterprise plans add live chat and a dedicated Slack channel.",
